\PYG{c+cm}{/* ============================================================}
\PYG{c+cm}{   RDML support — reader, processing\PYGZhy{}state gate, and raw\PYGZhy{}file priority}
\PYG{c+cm}{   \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}}
\PYG{c+cm}{   The page reads what the instrument\PYGZsq{}s own software analysed. An RDML file that}
\PYG{c+cm}{   carries only raw fluorescence has not been analysed by anyone, and an RDML}
\PYG{c+cm}{   written by a third\PYGZhy{}party tool carries somebody else\PYGZsq{}s analysis. Neither is the}
\PYG{c+cm}{   instrument\PYGZsq{}s record, so neither is evaluated by the laboratory profile: both}
\PYG{c+cm}{   are read, shown and exported, and reported as \PYGZdq{}Profile not applicable\PYGZdq{}.}
\PYG{c+cm}{   Where the same experiment is present as a vendor container AND as an RDML}
\PYG{c+cm}{   export, the vendor container wins and the RDML is kept as a companion.}
\PYG{c+cm}{   ============================================================ */}

